-- DB update 2026_09_10_10 -> 2026_09_10_11
-- Arcane Mage rework (docs/arcane-mage-rework-design.md) - playtest bugfix pass (2026-09-08),
-- see .claude/skills/class-rework/SKILL.md. Fixes 5 confirmed data bugs found during live
-- playtest; see docs/arcane-mage-rework-design.md's Progress notes for the investigation of the
-- other reported items (2 turned out not to reproduce against live data, 1 - Missile Barrage - is
-- still open pending more repro detail from the user).
--
-- 200092 (Arcane Overload's damage sub-spell, spell_mage_arcane_overload::HandleHit,
-- spell_mage.cpp): ImplicitTargetA_1 was 1 (TARGET_UNIT_CASTER), a leftover default that made the
-- hit always land on the caster regardless of the CastCustomSpell target passed in - "Arcane
-- Overload deals damage to you and not the target". Fixed to 6 (TARGET_UNIT_TARGET_ENEMY).
-- EffectMiscValue_1 (the SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE school index - distinct from the row's own
-- SchoolMask column, which was already 64/Arcane) was left at its 0 (Physical) default, so the hit
-- rolled as Physical damage - "need[s] to be in the Arcane School". Fixed to 6 (Arcane). Note:
-- Temporal Convergence (200078) and Arcane Overload's shell (200079) were investigated too - both
-- already show SchoolMask 64 (Arcane) at every level and neither has this MiscValue field wired to
-- anything (200078 has no damage effect at all), so no further school-related fix was needed there.
--
-- 11210/12592/200071 (Alacrity, all 3 ranks): tooltip retitled from generic "cooldown reduction"
-- to "Cooldown Haste", matching the actual custom-stat name (docs/itemization-changes.md) - the
-- underlying mechanic (Player::GetCooldownHastePercentage()) was already correct, only the text
-- was stale.
--
-- 11237/12463/12464 (Arcane Stability, all 3 ranks): the "Increases your Proc Chance by 3/6/9%"
-- clause (effect2, SPELL_AURA_MOD_CUSTOM_STAT_PCT) was added in Phase 2 but never made it into the
-- tooltip text - Description_Lang_enUS now states it explicitly per rank, alongside the pre-existing
-- pushback-reduction clause.
--
-- 44394/44395/44396 (Incanter's Absorption, all 3 ranks): Description_Lang_enUS still read as the
-- unmodified real-game tooltip ("does not have the right tooltip and looks like its the old
-- version") even though Phase 2/3 added the Spellsteal cooldown reduction (effect2) and the
-- shield-grant proc (spell_mage_incanters_absorption_shield, spell_mage.cpp) on top of the
-- pre-existing ward-absorb-into-damage-buff clause (kept working, untouched). Text now describes
-- all three, plus the rank-3 capstone (an extra Spellsteal target, spell_mage_spellsteal).
--
-- Known limitation, NOT fixed here (pre-existing, documented in docs/itemization-changes.md
-- section "Flat, gear-independent grants - SPELL_AURA_MOD_CUSTOM_STAT_PCT"): Arcane Stability's
-- Proc Chance and Alacrity's Cooldown Haste bonuses are granted via SPELL_AURA_MOD_CUSTOM_STAT_PCT,
-- which never writes PLAYER_FIELD_COMBAT_RATING and so never reaches
-- client/CustomCharacterStats/CustomCharacterStats.lua's character-sheet percentage display (it
-- reads the native GetCombatRating() API, which only sees the rating pool). The bonus is real and
-- live in combat (confirmed: Alacrity's cast-time reduction) - only the character-sheet number is
-- missing, and doc already flags this as "worth doing if a flat-granting talent needs to be
-- visible in that panel" - now one does. Needs a server->client push (e.g. an addon message) added
-- to the Lua panel, out of scope for a data-only bugfix pass.
--
-- Also investigated, found NOT reproducible against live data (no fix shipped):
-- - "Conjure Food and Water are trainable when they shouldn't be": live trainer_spell already has
--   no rows for 587/5504/10140/27090/28612/33717 on TrainerId 16 (the one real mage trainer, 256
--   rows - TrainerId 17 and 18-30 are all pre-existing minimal starting-zone stub trainers with a
--   handful of level 1-6 rows each, not alternate "full" mage trainers) - only 42955 (Conjure
--   Refreshment) remains. Looks to already have been cleaned up by unrelated later work.
-- - "Trainer doesn't teach Brilliance Aura/Slow/Arcane Blast/Arcane Ward/Time Warp/Presence of
--   Mind/Mass Invisibility/Invisibility": live trainer_spell on TrainerId 16 already has correct
--   rows for all 8 (200067/31589/30451/200068/200070/12043/200069/66) at their designed ReqLevel.
--   If still not showing up in-game, likely either the test character was below the relevant
--   ReqLevel, or the NPC visited maps to one of the stub TrainerIds above rather than 16 -
--   worth double-checking which trainer NPC and character level were used.
--
-- Produced by `python3 apps/dbc-tools/generate.py` from apps/dbc-tools/source/spells/mage_talents.csv,
-- then hand-extracted to just the 10 rows this pass touches - a full run also reproduces a large
-- pre-existing, unrelated spell_dbc diff (~460 spells across every class), same discipline as
-- every previous migration in this rework (see data/sql/updates/db_world/2026_09_01_01.sql for
-- precedent).
--
-- Regenerate/extend via: python3 apps/dbc-tools/generate.py (see apps/dbc-tools/README.md)

